@page "/components/direction"

<PageTitle>Direction — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Direction</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    shadcn ships a <code>DirectionProvider</code> so Radix can mirror its own positioning in a right-to-left page. There is nothing to provide here: every component in this library is laid out with logical properties and native elements, so <code>&lt;html dir="rtl"&gt;</code> is the whole configuration. The two compilers that measure — the dropdown's placement and the resizable handle — read <code>getBoundingClientRect</code>, which is already direction-aware.
</p>


